- `action(n1, "Start Pathology process")` and `action(n24, "End pathology procedure")`: Hallucinated steps with no corresponding behavior in the source description, violating SMC1.
- `precedence(n3, n4)`: Sequences "Create barcode scan at registration start" to occur after "Registration gross pathology request" completes, contradicting the source text which directs to create the scan "During the 'Registration gross pathology request' step... at the start." (violates SMC3)
- `defines(v1, "Digitalization?", {"Yes", "No"})` and `defines(v2, "Digitalization?", {"Yes", "No"})`: Specify capitalized values for the decision options, whereas the source text explicitly uses lowercase `"no"` and `"yes"` for the conditional answers. (violates SMC6)